  "body": "From - https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/23819#discussion_r4331373689\r\n\r\nThe log4j section of the Docker usage guide (`docs/getting-started/docker.md`) still described the old log4j 1.x `.properties` behaviour. \r\n\r\nThis PR updates it to match what `KafkaDockerWrapper` actually does with `log4j2.yaml` and `tools-log4j2.yaml`\r\n",
